  "purpose": "CROWDLEG recorder sizing trial (Idea Desk C, owner MAIN): page count of the public trade tape over one fixed past 30 minute window (2026-09-20 18:00 to 18:30Z, a Sunday), to size a combo trade read. The reader counts pages, rows, and rows whose ticker starts with KXMVE; no price, size or side is read.",
  "heldout": "One fixed past window, 2026-09-20T18:00Z to 18:30Z, chosen before every held-out start found in HELDOUT_REGISTRY Table 2 (all on or after 2026-10-03). FOR AUDITOR B: the unfiltered tape holds trades of EVERY market traded in that half hour, which land on the public data branch; check that no card holds that half hour as held-out. The reader opens only the row count and the ticker prefix.",
  "host": "api.elections.kalshi.com",
  "base_path": "/trade-api/v2",
  "pacing_seconds": 1.0,
  "stop_rules": {
   "pause_seconds_on_429": "5, doubling to 60",
   "stop_after_consecutive_429": 3,
   "note": "a 429 is waited out with a doubling pause and the same request is asked again; three in a row end the run; no other address, no proxy, no retry around a refusal"
  },
  "allowed_endpoints": [
   {
    "name": "trades_list",
    "method": "GET",
    "path_pattern": "/markets/trades",
    "params_allowed": [
